# Work machine: Quadro P4000/P2000 (Pascal) + RDP access from locked-down
# Windows clients (mstsc is often the only allowed client there).

# --- GPU: Pascal needs the legacy 580xx branch (last to support it).
#     Unlike the open branch there is no prebuilt per-kernel variant, so this
#     one IS a DKMS package and stays pinned here; bootstrap still supplies the
#     matching kernel headers. [cachyos] repo, or AUR on plain Arch. ---
nvidia-580xx-dkms
nvidia-580xx-utils

# --- RDP session stack (xrdp serves an XFCE/X11 session; Wayland can't do RDP) ---
xorg-server
xorg-xinit
xfce4
